{
    "title": "ONE@Work (formerly Even)",
    "description": "ONE@Work (formerly Even) partners with leading employers, like Walmart, to provide simple tools that help you take control of your pay \u2014 without the hassle.\r\n\r\nThrough ONE@Work, you can: \r\n\r\n-Get paid early* \u2013 With Instapay, access your net earnings before payday to help cover the unexpected. No fees** or hidden interest.\r\n\r\n-Track your earnings \u2013 See your work schedule and track how much you\u2019ll make per shift and per paycheck \u2013 no more guesswork.**\r\n\r\n-Save automatically \u2013 Choose a percentage you want to save and we\u2019ll deduct it from your paycheck automatically.\r\n\r\n-Budget easily \u2013 When you connect your bank account, ONE@Work helps you calculate what\u2019s okay to spend.\r\n\r\n\r\nONE@Work is only available as an employer-provided benefit. \r\n\r\nONE@Work Save is powered by Cross River Bank, Member FDIC or Coastal Community Bank, Member FDIC.\r\n\r\n*Instapay is currently unavailable for Walmart  associates in NY. \r\n\r\n \r\n**  Only available for members whose employers have configured this benefit within the app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "ONE@Work (formerly Even) partners with leading employers, like Walmart, to provide simple tools that help you take control of your pay \u2014 without the hassle.<br><br>Through ONE@Work, you can: <br><br>-Get paid early* \u2013 With Instapay, access your net earnings before payday to help cover the unexpected. No fees** or hidden interest.<br><br>-Track your earnings \u2013 See your work schedule and track how much you\u2019ll make per shift and per paycheck \u2013 no more guesswork.**<br><br>-Save automatically \u2013 Choose a percentage you want to save and we\u2019ll deduct it from your paycheck automatically.<br><br>-Budget easily \u2013 When you connect your bank account, ONE@Work helps you calculate what\u2019s okay to spend.<br><br><br>ONE@Work is only available as an employer-provided benefit. <br><br>ONE@Work Save is powered by Cross River Bank, Member FDIC or Coastal Community Bank, Member FDIC.<br><br>*Instapay is currently unavailable for Walmart  associates in NY. <br><br> <br>**  Only available for members whose employers have configured this benefit within the app.",
